# Speakers: "A bio is at most 500 characters". Characters are Unicode code points, so an emoji counts 1, not 2
# (Java's String.length() and @Size count UTF-16 units: 500 emojis used to be refused). Generated: 500 of each.
# Open question for the PO: emoji sequences like 👍🏽 (2 code points) count 2 here.

